    "updated_at": "2025-09-29T09:40:26Z",
    "body": "The proposed solution doesn't work given how HTML parsing works -- the `details` and `summary` elements get moved out of the table due to [foster parenting](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#foster-parent).",
