    "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:27:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-29T13:27:02Z",
    "body": "@zcorpan Yes, that is the purpose of this proposal. Due to foster parenting, this example that would otherwise appear to work does not because it is invalid markup.\n\nSimilar to how support for `hr` elements inside of `select` elements was recently added, I am proposing adding support for `details`/`summary` inside of `table` and (related) elements.",
