    "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:49:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-20T12:49:25Z",
    "body": "The `openable` explainer of Open-UI by @lukewarlow and @scottaohara has an alternative proposal in their example: https://open-ui.org/components/openable.explainer/\n\n```html\n<table>\n  ...\n  <tr>\n    <th>Name of row</th>\n    <td>...</td>\n    <td>\n       <button commandfor=\"moar\" command=\"toggle-openable\">view additional rows</button>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr openable id=\"moar\">...</tr>\n  ...\n</table>\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
